  "routeAdjustment": "Reuse the pointwise actual one-form law and finite original differential support. Native punctured-neighborhood comparison with the cofinite filter replaces the longer external punctured chart algebra. Native nonzero-derivative transport supplies the punctured inverse limit. Existing original logarithmic readings and native divided power series give the exact residue transport. The regular and simple-pole clauses are assembled in one actual-source consumer.",
  "discharged": "The complete source cell-coefficient local calculus is proved for actual original differentials and genuine coordinates: fixed-chart regular identity, coefficient analyticity, regular pullback identity, and exact simple-pole residue divided by the cell-coordinate difference plus an analytic remainder. The residue is literal originalPlaceEval of uniformizer times differential coefficient. Finite original differential support gives regularity on punctured neighborhoods, and the actual original logarithmic reading supplies the pole model. This removes the coefficient-calculus obligation needed for contour reciprocity; it does not construct a dissection or prove reciprocity.",
